{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"rank of a module homomorphism rank of a module homomorphism","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md","fileName":"Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Rank of a Module Homomorphism","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 20:25\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra","Buchsbaum-Eisenbud Exactness Criterion","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"rank of a module homomorphism rank of a module homomorphism","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md","fileName":"Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Rank of a Module Homomorphism","heading":"Rank of a Module Homomorphism","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"For a homomorphism represented by a matrix A and an R-module M, the rank on M is the largest r for which the ideal generated by the r-by-r minors of A is not contained in Ann(M).\n\nThis determinantal definition works over rings where ordinary row reduction is insufficient. Rank conditions combine with depth of minor ideals in the [[Buchsbaum-Eisenbud Exactness Criterion]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra","Buchsbaum-Eisenbud Exactness Criterion","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Rank of a Module Homomorphism.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ra